"1. 打开 Mac 微信「设置 → 通用」，开启「长按 Fn 进行全局语音输入」，并在系统隐私设置中允许微信使用麦克风。\n2. 将微信的语音输入设备设为「系统默认」或「Chromecast Mic」。\n3. 点击任意软件的输入框，按住遥控器语音键说话，松手即可出字。\n\n注：语音识别由微信完成，Remote Vibe 只负责把遥控器声音送入虚拟麦克风并触发快捷键，不会读取语音或文字内容。" = "1. In WeChat for Mac (Settings → General), turn on Hold Fn for Global Voice Input and allow microphone access.\n2. Set WeChat’s audio input to System Default or Chromecast Mic.\n3. Focus any text field, hold the remote voice button to speak, and release to insert text.\n\nNote: Speech recognition is handled by WeChat. Remote Vibe only routes remote audio to the virtual microphone and triggers shortcuts—it never reads your speech or text.";
